ct**.\n\n---\n\n✅ **Correct Answer: None of the given options (including ‘2’) are accurate based on the video content.**\n\nIf forced to choose from the given options, **‘2’ (Hands-up) is definitively wrong**. The video does not show any exercise led by the substitute teacher."}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 60, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1515.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1516.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1517.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1518.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1519.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1520.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1521.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1522.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1523.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1524.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1525.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1526.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1527.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1528.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1529.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1530.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1531.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1532.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1533.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1534.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1535.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/uusf1qG_uZ4/frames/frame_1536.